@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+# Three Miles import thunks
+
+Retail PE import descriptors prove all three mss32.dll slots:
+00629D92 -> VA00BBAB04 _AIL_set_3D_orientation@28
+00629EA0 -> VA00BBAB98 _AIL_quick_startup@20
+00629EF4 -> VA00BBAB34 _AIL_stream_info@20
+
+Each complete body is FF25 + the four-byte IAT address (6B).
+The source follows admitted D3DX9ImportThunks.cpp: typed C++ forwarding
+through genuine decorated PE import pointer symbols, without aliases,
+replacement data, assembly, pins or synthetic ownership. Parameter widths
+follow existing Miles callers; PE names independently fix stdcall widths.
+No BFME1 donor identity is needed for named target PE imports.
+
+Prior /O1 trials emit an extra EBP frame. /O2 emits each exact six-byte
+jump. tools/flag_defaults.py propose compiled both configurations and
+admitted the source override because the region default loses the startup
+row. The override was generated by that tool, not manually edited.
+
+Normal add_match verified all three rows and all three named-import
+references. Owner astra-s1; model gpt-6-astra.
